":"依「發行人募集與發行海外有價證券處理準則」§3第1項規定,上市公司或上櫃公司,得申報募集與發行海外公司債、海外股票、參與發行海外存託憑證及申報其已發行之股票於國外證券市場交易。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"493a38205853a860523aaa1fd1c09a5d2165bbe683d58464f0d36b1400791b19","explanationSegmentsSha256":"784b72a1b94822dac354f9eeb143735383e6dc5efc2196768f8bf3d5ea540432"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0003","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":3,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-01.webp","x":183,"y":1103,"width":1037,"height":210,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1303,"width":1160,"height":72,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"現行法令允許本國人可赴海外發行有價證券之種類,包括下列何者？甲、海外公司債;乙、海外存託憑證;丙、海外票券;丁、海外股票","optionTexts":{"1":"僅甲、乙、丙","2":"僅乙、丙、丁","3":"僅甲、乙、丁","4":"甲、乙、丙、丁皆是"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行海外有價證券處理準則」§3第1項規定,上市公司或上櫃公司,得申報募集與發行海外公司債、海外股票、參與發行海外存託憑證及申報其已發行之股票於國外證券市場交易。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"c4688f2f27f151f6e27022bf982db56793914bd6eec658b36b273bb6670acbf5","explanationSegmentsSha256":"cab3e77bfad5a9ed8f4d1b4c5bbe853a93174356c6a6b4aee19d18952b221d03"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0004","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":4,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-01.webp","x":183,"y":1365,"width":1037,"height":159,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-01.webp","x":60,"y":1514,"width":1160,"height":70,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"目前我國之上市上櫃公司於海外籌措資金之方式為何?","optionTexts":{"1":"發行海外公司債","2":"將已發行之股票申請於國外證券市場交易","3":"參與發行海外存託憑證","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行海外有價證券處理準則」§3第1項規定,上市公司或上櫃公司,得申報募集與發行海外公司債、海外股票、參與發行海外存託憑證及申報其已發行之股票於國外證券市場交易。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"56f1f19ec1d62aa1ae88fb70ae66b8e430c444af33f7267612aba6ac7ede753a","explanationSegmentsSha256":"b42cecbad60c18f91db06834a66d3e352319f8e7595d190e9005eeb87c96661c"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0005","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":5,"answer":"3","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":1,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-01.webp","x":187,"y":1574,"width":1033,"height":114,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-02.webp","x":187,"y":205,"width":1033,"height":115,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":310,"width":1160,"height":252,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"我國之未上市櫃公司依法可運用下列何方式赴海外籌措資金?","optionTexts":{"1":"發行海外存託憑證","2":"發行海外股票","3":"以所持有其他上櫃公司股票為認購標的之海外附認股權公司債","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行海外有價證券處理準則」§3第4項規定,未上市或未符合上櫃審查準則§3之公開發行公司得申請募集與發行海外普通公司債及以所持有其他上市公司或符合上櫃審查準則§3 規定之上櫃公司股票作為償還標的之海外可交換公司債及海外附認股權公司債。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"32e4bf46dad4d4ca3835b88eb21f490dfb98e86a9cbed9553430a0d408678d11","explanationSegmentsSha256":"aa4f653efeb8487885cb7a62977cf65396d94bffc43a6ceab950e10c18299599"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0006","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":6,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-02.webp"