ber":8,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-02.webp","x":188,"y":1336,"width":1032,"height":205,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":2,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-02.webp","x":60,"y":1531,"width":1160,"height":132,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752},{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":196,"width":1160,"height":120,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"發行人發行海外可轉換公司債經金融監督管理委員會核准發行,應於海外公司債發行後十日內,檢附下列哪些書件向金融監督管理委員會申報?","optionTexts":{"1":"發行當地國證券法令規定所編製之公開說明書","2":"存託契約書副本","3":"發行合約書副本","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆是"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行海外有價證券處理準則」§27規定: 一、依發行當地國證券法令規定所編製之公開說明書。二、發行合約書副本。三、附可轉換或認購海外存託憑證條件者,其存託契約及保管契約副本。(共十款)","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"5acdbc1c2cbd103c8c6f24b693073cbc03e7159e4cf7a61c6fcf5343ced823dc","explanationSegmentsSha256":"fc9443a16e470351b8dfb1e0709877cfecb545269a67db29f26e94ea637f7b4c"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0009","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":9,"answer":"4","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-03.webp","x":187,"y":306,"width":1033,"height":156,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":3,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-03.webp","x":60,"y":452,"width":1160,"height":208,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"發行人申報發行海外股票,應檢具發行計畫,下列何者非須載明事項?","optionTexts":{"1":"發行目的","2":"預定發行日期","3":"每股發行價格之訂定方式","4":"盈餘轉增資之獲利情況"},"explanationText":"依「發行人募集與發行海外有價證券處理準則」§32規定: 一、發行目的。二、預定發行日期、發行股數、每股發行價格之訂定方式及發行總金額。三、發行及交易地點。六、以現金增資發行新股者,其募集資金運用計畫及預計可能產生效益。(共九項)","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha25