指定之網站公告,下列事項何者有誤?","optionTexts":{"1":"海外公司債總額","2":"發行價格及預定發行日期","3":"海外公司債償還方法及期限","4":"海外公司債之違約率"},"explanationText":"選項(4)應為募集海外公司債之利率,詳參5-1.3說明。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"0d1d610666227557b927e7455d937c0f689b2bdfff6e417920c3ea7d391e1b11","explanationSegmentsSha256":"c3bf5cf224c040a24169b8f48b9be5f360877aafd90f00f653c0b0c2ee120df3"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0016","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":16,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-04.webp","x":166,"y":791,"width":1054,"height":116,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":897,"width":1160,"height":164,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關證券商經營特定外國債券業務,以下敘述何者正確?","optionTexts":{"1":"採自營方式","2":"採競價方式","3":"得為附條件交易","4":"選項(1)(2)(3)皆正確"},"explanationText":"依櫃買中心「證券商經營自行買賣特定外國債券業務管理辦法」§22第1項規定,證券商經營特定外國債券業務應採自營方式, 以議價方法為之,且不得為附條件交易。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"6fb32c5b08f149bd9668bd063b8d0343ff125aecdd0fa11281c86f5bc8a3aaa3","explanationSegmentsSha256":"82b36898401b0bb15cfb5fde6409f22c629e837a4792b18cc36412b06d15e1b5"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0017","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":17,"answer":"2","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-04.webp","x":174,"y":1051,"width":1046,"height":259,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":4,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-04.webp","x":60,"y":1300,"width":1160,"height":388,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關證券商經營特定外國債券業務,以下哪些債券可列入特定外國債券範圍?甲.信用評等一定等級以上之外國中央政府債券乙.信用評等一定等級以上之外國公司債券丙.可轉換公司債丁.不動產抵押貸款債券","optionTexts":{"1":"僅甲","2":"僅甲、乙","3":"僅甲、乙、丙","4":"甲、乙、丙、丁皆可"},"explanationText":"依櫃買中心「證券商經營自行買賣特定外國債券業務管理辦法」§22規定,證券商經營自行買賣特定外國債券業務,其特定外國債券應符合下列條件:二、不得為結構型債券、具股權性質之債券、次順位債券、具損失吸收能力之債券(Total Loss Absorbing Capacity, 簡稱 TLAC 債券)、不動產抵押貸款債券(Mortgage Backed Security; MBS)、抵押債務債券(Collateralized Debt Obligation;CDO)及涉及大陸地區證券市場之債券。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"14235178df175c6f7481b8a2688ab23bcb666043c240c1492361823b1d6cd9ef","explanationSegmentsSha256":"0692feaca84ba2aa647abcb0a0c332f4479246737f3a1a70130d9fd58f03cdcf"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0018","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle":"證券交易相關實務","chapterId":"第五章","chapterTitle":"第五章","number":18,"answer":"1","sourceFile":"證券交易相關實務-第五章.pdf","questionSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-05.webp","x":166,"y":213,"width":1054,"height":203,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"explanationSegments":[{"page":5,"src":"pdf-pages/securities-trading-practice/ch05/page-05.webp","x":60,"y":406,"width":1160,"height":68,"pageWidth":1239,"pageHeight":1752}],"answerMask":null,"questionText":"有關證券商經營特定外國債券業務,以下哪些債券可列入特定外國債券範圍?甲.信用評等一定等級以上之外國公司債券乙. 結構型債券丙.次順位債券丁.抵押債務債券","optionTexts":{"1":"僅甲","2":"僅甲、乙","3":"僅甲、乙、丙","4":"甲、乙、丙、丁皆可"},"explanationText":"依櫃買中心「證券商經營自行買賣特定外國債券業務管理辦法」§22規定,證券商經營自行買賣特定外國債券業務,其特定外國債券應符合下列條件:二、不得為結構型債券、具股權性質之債券、次順位債券、具損失吸收能力之債券(Total Loss Absorbing Capacity, 簡稱 TLAC 債券)、不動產抵押貸款債券(Mortgage Backed Security; MBS)、抵押債務債券(Collateralized Debt Obligation;CDO)及涉及大陸地區證券市場之債券。","textSource":{"kind":"project-scan-pages-only","questionSegmentsSha256":"55fd83e92ced239425af38383a7b3692a6298dc4df8ec3748a583c40f151e239","explanationSegmentsSha256":"85c5eacd9e5924e6372c8879e7519d85829cfcdc93c0e188fcbfeabcc86d0f8b"}},{"id":"securities-trading-practice-ch05-pdf-0019","bankId":"securities-trading-practice","bankTitle"